{"id":"5949","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5949_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus_clouds-lithometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>层积云是一种灰色或发白的云，或二者兼有，呈块状、片状或层状，几乎始终有阴暗的部分。它由棋盘状、圆团、卷轴等形状组成，它们不是纤维状（除了雨幡），而且或有可能融合。大部分规则排列的小云素的视宽大于5°。在本图片中，我们可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">有卷轴的典型灰色层积云</span>，它是成层云种。当时，它正开始变薄并抬升，但整体仍很厚，遮挡住太阳的位置；因此，它属于蔽光云类。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">霾被阻滞在远处的城市前面</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，布罗德梅多斯","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 25'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 50'' E","date":"28 July 2006 1048 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.0"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5949_syn_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus_clouds-lithometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当地时间09:00，在图片拍摄位置（红色箭头）东北方向的高压单体随着冷锋向东抵近而逐渐变弱。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2006，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5949_upper_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus_clouds-lithometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>当地时间09:00在澳大利亚维多利亚州墨尔本机场的探测（WMO 94866）显示出逆温，底部高度1700米。逆温在减弱并抬升。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}